<title>USA: Isle ISD 473, Minn., won by Nike Securities.</title>
<headline>Isle ISD 473, Minn., won by Nike Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nike Securities said it won $6.250 million of Isle ISD, 473, Minn., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.514 percent.</p>
</text>
